{"availability":"available","full":"xai-org/xai-sdk-ts","name":"xai-sdk-ts","description":"The official TypeScript SDK for the SpaceXAI API","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":37,"forks":2,"created":"2026-08-26T16:09:05Z","updated":"2026-10-02T22:13:59Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://www.npmjs.com/package/@xai-official/sdk","topics":["grok","sdk","spacexai","typescript"],"demo":null,"color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z","stars":37,"forks":2}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The official TypeScript SDK for the SpaceXAI API","Use Grok from TypeScript with a typed, ESM client built on the SpaceXAI REST API. The SDK has no runtime dependencies and includes streaming, structured output, function tools, image input, image and video generation, file uploads, batch processing, text to speech and transcription, multi-turn conversations, and access to usage and HTTP metadata.","Experimental. This SDK is in early development. It currently covers the Responses API, image and video generation, the Files, Batch, and Voice APIs, tokenization, and model and account lookup, and its interfaces may change between releases before 1.0. Pin an exact version and read the changelog when upgrading. Feedback and bug reports are welcome in issues."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/xai-org/xai-sdk-ts/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"024cf44ecd01a99525507e40c4846f183c387bcf6a8891e7584367f38fc8d160","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T09:36:58.563Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"The official TypeScript SDK for the SpaceXAI API","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/xai-org/xai-sdk-ts/blob/main/READ